 "background": "A mother-daughter dialogue with a twist. Why do you sit all day at the embroidery frame? Not a silk headscarf, mother: I am embroidering a Macedonian flag, so I can become a young *komita* and cover (mourn) the voivoda Delčev, who died for Macedonia. The hidden object in the embroidery is a trick that appears in many Balkan songs.",
